{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212690","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212690","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121269001:1":{"text":"How do you fare, friend?","source_cn":"朋友，进展如何？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D136DC5E832BDAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How do you fare, friend?","female":"How do you fare, friend?","variant_male_record_index":"117494","variant_female_record_index":"117495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1121269001":{"text":"How do you fare, friend?","source_cn":"朋友，进展如何？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D136DC5E832BDAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How do you fare, friend?","female":"How do you fare, friend?","variant_male_record_index":"117494","variant_female_record_index":"117495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121269002:0":{"text":"Is that so... Lily May is a fine, warm name. I'm glad to meet you anew.","source_cn":"是吗……五月，是个温暖的名字。很高兴以这样的方式重新认识你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74F2DDEF6FFCACC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121269003:0":{"text":"I didn't want to run from my guilt, so I came back to accept whatever punishment I deserve.","source_cn":"我不想逃避罪责，于是回来了。无论什么样的惩罚，我都接受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F4263A0115AD315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121269004:0":{"text":"For that, I salute you.","source_cn":"对此，我向你表示敬意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B6321F21368BE30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121269005:1":{"text":"Alright, Lily May, please leave with my soldiers to await judgement.","source_cn":"那么五月，请你随我的士兵离开，等候审判吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49FE9958C65EDC67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121269006:0":{"text":"Yes.","source_cn":"嗯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D95B7400BEFF62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1121269007:0":{"text":"The soldiers take Lily May away. Before leaving, she gazes deeply at us, as if trying to express her gratitude.","source_cn":"士兵将五月带走了，临走前，她深深地望向了我们，似乎又说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93A5C396CFB1B7CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121269008:0":{"text":"There are some things I've been afraid to say in front of Lily May.","source_cn":"有些事情，当着五月的面，我一直不敢说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E505A3D03EA6775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1121269008":{"text":"There are some things I've been afraid to say in front of Lily May.","source_cn":"有些事情，当着五月的面，我一直不敢说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E505A3D03EA6775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121269009:0":{"text":"Based on Lily May's ailments, Arden worked out what kind of evil magic Illucia used on her. ","source_cn":"根据五月的病症，雅顿贤者已经推测出黑金女士在她身上用了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3697141299D8D009","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121269010:0":{"text":"A lot of it made my head spin, but it seems like dark magic that speeds up the flow of time was used on her body.","source_cn":"我不懂魔法，听得云里雾里，那好像是一种能让身体的时间流...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x371F7A68EC06FD95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121269011:0":{"text":"In some places, catalysts like this are used on crops to make them grow faster.","source_cn":"有些地方培育作物时会加入催化剂，让作物的生长速度变快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9698371DE5B277C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121269012:0":{"text":"I bet this is why she was called Aves 11.","source_cn":"我猜，她被叫做阿尔法十一也是这个原因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB6B25947DB534E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1121269013:0":{"text":"Before her, Illucia was probably experimenting on many others. Aves 10, Aves 9, so on...","source_cn":"在她之前，黑金女士也进行过类似的实验。只是阿尔法十和阿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2F221767A003C2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121269014:0":{"text":"We will investigate further and expose this evil for what it is!","source_cn":"我们一定会严查此事，早日揭开他们的黑幕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2ADAC9759AEA279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121269015:0":{"text":"I'll be paying close attention to the Adamant Syndicate's movements, I'll write to you if I learn of anything. Feel free to do the same.","source_cn":"我也会多留意黑金商会的动向，要是有什么线索，我会写信告...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA6AFD0C1E353537","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121269016:0":{"text":"It's an honor to have met you, Lenya.","source_cn":"当然，能与你相识，我很荣幸。蕾米雅小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FEF91BD50BAFC42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121269017:0":{"text":"Oh, don't be so formal, old man. I'll take my leave now. My mouth is watering thinking about the food at the Traveler's Light...","source_cn":"少说客套话。那我先走一步，我还惦记着旅人灯火的饭菜呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB132DE7D7CF37D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121269018:0":{"text":"Bye-bye, you two!","source_cn":"拜拜啦二位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC2E48A9976BEB89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1121269018":{"text":"Bye-bye, you two!","source_cn":"拜拜啦二位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC2E48A9976BEB89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1121269019:0":{"text":"Alright, I'll look after Lily May. She doesn't deserve harsh punishment.","source_cn":"好的。五月的事情我会好好处理。她不该受到过重的处罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EC482F7A9AF884C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1121269022:0":{"text":"But the news that the Adamant Syndicate had performed such a cruel and forbidden experiment... it boils my blood.","source_cn":"但是，黑金商会竟然做过如此残忍的禁忌实验……这个消息令...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60FDAA34836D9B78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1121269023:0":{"text":"A bunch of fanatical Hypogean worshippers. I can only imagine what else they have in store.","source_cn":"一群狂热的恶魔信徒……我无法想象他们还会做出怎样的恶行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x627747779B15E712","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1121269024:0":{"text":"Even though we're onto their wicked ways, we must not let our guard drop for a second. The Adamant Syndicate will continue to scheme in the dark.","source_cn":"即使被我们打压了气焰，可我相信，黑金商会依然在暗中密谋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E233EF0DB1FEC7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1121269025:0":{"text":"But as for now, let us enjoy a rare moment of peace.","source_cn":"至于现在，就让你我享受片刻的安宁吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x990033644E28C8AC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But as for now, let us enjoy a rare moment of peace.","female":"But as for now, let us enjoy a rare moment of peace.","variant_male_record_index":"117520","variant_female_record_index":"117521","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:0:1":{"text":"I should go, too.","source_cn":"我也该走了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7918A6D3E62D1EB7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I should go, too.","female":"I should go, too.","variant_male_record_index":"62836","variant_female_record_index":"62837","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1121269020:0":{"text":"I swear she will be judged fairly.","source_cn":"我一定会让她得到公正的判决。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA27BDAEEC942BE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1121269021:0":{"text":"She cannot be fully blamed after enduring the controlling bite of dark magic. Fear not.","source_cn":"再加上她受过黑魔法控制，我想，处罚不会太重。你放心。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x99C5A5B624139D4A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"She cannot be fully blamed after enduring the controlling bite of dark magic. Fear not.","female":"She cannot be fully blamed after enduring the controlling bite of dark magic. Fear not.","variant_male_record_index":"117515","variant_female_record_index":"117516","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:1:2":{"text":"Will Lily May be punished?","source_cn":"五月会被重罚吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x052071152A5835F0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Will Lily May be punished?","female":"Will Lily May be punished?","variant_male_record_index":"62838","variant_female_record_index":"62839","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"What is it?","source_cn":"什么事？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5A6459443989F199","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What is it?","female":"What is it?","variant_male_record_index":"62834","variant_female_record_index":"62835","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"A lot has happened. So...","source_cn":"（讲述事情的经过）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x89DB055DC165C956","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"A lot has happened. So...","female":"A lot has happened. So...","variant_male_record_index":"62832","variant_female_record_index":"62833","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:霍根":{"text":"Hogan","source":"霍根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:五月":{"text":"Lily May","source":"五月","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"Black Screen","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:蕾米雅":{"text":"Lenya","source":"蕾米雅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":33,"localized_text_count":32,"speaker_count":4}}